<title>USA: Calif. State Univ., $4 mln won by BA Securities. [CORRECTED 00:38 GMT 2/10]</title>
<headline>Calif. State Univ., $4 mln won by BA Securities. [CORRECTED 00:38 GMT 2/10]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>BA Securities (corrects from Merrill Lynch) said it won $4 million of California State University Trustees, housing system revenue bonds, Series AU, with a true interest cost of 5.56 percent (corrects from 5.5406 percent).</p>
</text>
